            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotemasi iruŋa ŋul ŋes atiar, “Mam sic kilai kanuka akuan naka erunanan lokatwan: kanukinyo kirebokinitere sio, komam kicamakinitai ainakin ainakinet naka EJAKAIT kotoma apakike naeseunitai nepepe kidwe luka Isirael?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
