        {
          "text": " Konye ituŋanan yenelai, komam ejai toma alosit, kosodi aiŋer aidar aleleŋio, egelario ituŋanan ŋin kotuŋake; naarai mam abu koinak ainakinet naka EJAKAIT kotoma apakike naeseunitai, ibwoki ituŋanan ŋin adiakareteke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
